{"title": "Reliable Talent", "pageid": 6874, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Reliable_Talent", "categories": ["Bugs", "Class features", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Reliable_Talent.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Reliable_Talent.webp/300px-Reliable_Talent.webp, /w/images/5/54/Reliable_Talent.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Reliable_Talent.webp/300px-Reliable_Talent.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Reliable_Talent.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Reliable Talent</b> is a passive feature gained by <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue\" title=\"Rogue\">rogues</a> at level 11. It treats any roll under 10 as a 10.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you make an <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a> with a <a href=\"/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a> you are <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with, the lowest result you can roll on the die is 10. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 11: <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue\" title=\"Rogue\">Rogue</a></li></ul>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Assassin%27s_Folly\" title=\"Assassin's Folly\">Assassin's Folly</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elliot\" title=\"Elliot\">Elliot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fishbait_Arno\" title=\"Fishbait Arno\">Fishbait Arno</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Friol\" title=\"Friol\">Friol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Lockjaw\" title=\"Lady Lockjaw\">Lady Lockjaw</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Snapbone\" title=\"Snapbone\">Snapbone</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This is a very versatile class feature, as it removes the floor principle of bounded accuracy<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> on all ability checks where a rogue has proficiency. When applied, this passive changes a d20 roll lower than 10 (including a 1) to a 10; modifiers are still applied afterwards. This can make skill checks of low to moderate DC where a rogue has proficiency guaranteed to succeed, and removes the chance to critically fail on those ability checks.</li>\n<li>This passive works well with the Githyanki racial feature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Knowledge\" title=\"Astral Knowledge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp/20px-Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp/30px-Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp/40px-Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Knowledge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp/20px-Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Astral_Knowledge_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Knowledge\" title=\"Astral Knowledge\">Astral Knowledge</a>.</li>\n<li>This passive helps in combat with <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks, such as those made while using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Greater Invisibility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/40px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Greater Invisibility\">Greater Invisibility</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Athletics\" title=\"Athletics\">Athletics</a> checks to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/30px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/40px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shove</a> enemies.</li>\n<li>For a <a href=\"/wiki/Multiclass\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Multiclass\">multiclassed</a> rogue character with this feature, it may be advisable to start as a rogue at level 1 (or respec with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> to do so) for proficiency in four skills.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>When <a href=\"/wiki/Karmic_Dice\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Karmic Dice\">Karmic Dice</a> are enabled, opposed dialog checks have a chance of automatically failing. This includes rolls that would have otherwise been a guaranteed success due to Reliable Talent.\n<ul><li>The religion checks against the <a href=\"/wiki/Mirror_of_Loss\" title=\"Mirror of Loss\">Mirror of Loss</a> are a notable example of where this can be detrimental</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> For a detailed explanation of bounded accuracy, see <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dandwiki.com/wiki/Understanding_Bounded_Accuracy_(5e_Guideline)\">Understanding Bounded Accuracy</a> on the D&amp;D Wiki. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li::after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt::after{content:\":\";font-weight:normal;font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dt:first-child::before,.mw-pars